1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,200
<i>I heard there's a new witness
in your case.</i>

2
00:00:02,333 --> 00:00:03,533
<i>What, do you have a big chance?</i>

3
00:00:03,667 --> 00:00:05,700
<i>You don't need the information
you need from me</i>

4
00:00:05,833 --> 00:00:06,733
<i> about Berdugo anymore?</i>

5
00:00:06,867 --> 00:00:07,800
<i> I still need it.</i>

6
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:10,167
<i>Will you keep your promise
or not?</i>

7
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,433
<i>I don't have the information
right now,</i>

8
00:00:11,567 --> 00:00:12,467
<i> but I will give it to you.</i>

9
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,000
<i>Since there is no supporting
evidence,</i>

10
00:00:14,133 --> 00:00:17,600
<i>everything Golda said in court
is considered hearsay.</i>

11
00:00:17,733 --> 00:00:20,467
<i>Actually, I think someone
talked to the judge,</i>

12
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,567
<i>which is why the decision
was made.</i>

13
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,700
<i>We've been looking for Golda
for a long time.</i>

14
00:00:23,833 --> 00:00:25,967
<i>I went through a lot
just to make her testify,</i>

15
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,667
<i>and then they'll just
throw it out?</i>

16
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,600
<i>So that's your plan
and Berdugo's.</i>

17
00:00:29,733 --> 00:00:32,367
<i>Everything has a price.
You just need to know how much.</i>

18
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,633
<i>I saw a deactivated account
that links to Theresa.</i>

19
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,433
<i>I just need to pinpoint
the location,</i>

20
00:00:37,567 --> 00:00:39,067
<i>then I'm sure that I will
find it.</i>

21
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,900
<i>My vlogger friend texted.
There's a big scoop.</i>

22
00:00:42,033 --> 00:00:42,967
<i>The vloggers' intention
was entertainment</i>

23
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,300
<i> and educational content,</i>

24
00:00:45,433 --> 00:00:48,467
<i>but what surprised them
was a disgusting sight.</i>

25
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,400
<i> Berdugo's group did that.</i>

26
00:00:50,533 --> 00:00:51,900
<i> If Berdugo catches me,</i>

27
00:00:52,033 --> 00:00:54,000
<i>that's what I'll definitely
end up with.</i>

28
00:00:54,133 --> 00:00:55,367
<i>Just like what happened
to Godfather Diego?</i>

29
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:56,600
<i> He just disappeared.</i>

30
00:00:56,733 --> 00:00:58,033
<i>What you have to do
is to make sure</i>

31
00:00:58,167 --> 00:01:00,767
<i>that those bodies can't be
connected to us.</i>

32
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:02,800
<i>One of the bodies
has been identified</i>

33
00:01:02,933 --> 00:01:03,867
<i> through dental records.</i>

34
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,100
<i> It's Major Aglipay, confirmed.</i>

35
00:01:06,233 --> 00:01:09,100
<i>Our contact at the precinct
said that Parak's ashes</i>

36
00:01:09,267 --> 00:01:11,200
<i>and belongings have been given
to relatives.</i>

37
00:01:11,333 --> 00:01:14,567
<i>We have to make sure that Parak
left nothing behind.</i>

38
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:18,167
<i>I just remembered our employee
asking for help.</i>

39
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:20,367
<i>I want to meet her as soon
as possible.</i>

40
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:22,533
<i>I saw it on the sleeve
of Godfather Diego's jacket.</i>

41
00:01:22,667 --> 00:01:24,267
<i>What are we going to do
with that?</i>

42
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:28,267
<i>Mom, I think that's the evidence
I'm looking for.</i>

43
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:30,800
<i>Why did you just tell me now?
Let's go after Chief!</i>

44
00:01:30,933 --> 00:01:32,033
<i> Let's give it to him!</i>

45
00:01:32,167 --> 00:01:33,200
<i>-What?
- No, Mom.</i>

46
00:01:33,333 --> 00:01:34,600
<i> I've learned my lesson.</i>

47
00:01:34,733 --> 00:01:37,900
<i>We need to see what's inside
before we surrender.</i>

48
00:01:57,433 --> 00:02:00,367
Peter, just tell Joey that...

49
00:02:02,233 --> 00:02:03,833
I'm sorry.

50
00:02:05,067 --> 00:02:07,067
I won't make it tonight.

51
00:02:08,667 --> 00:02:11,367
Because I found Theresa's
possible location

52
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:13,000
based on the IP address.

53
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:19,133
Yes, from the phone that I got
from Liza's date.

54
00:02:19,267 --> 00:02:21,000
I'm checking it out now.

55
00:02:21,133 --> 00:02:22,600
I'll call you back.

56
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,533
Are you really here, Theresa?

57
00:02:51,267 --> 00:02:53,800
Peter, what took you so long?

58
00:02:53,933 --> 00:02:55,833
I've been waiting for you
for some time now.

59
00:02:56,933 --> 00:02:58,533
Where is Jin Ho?
Why aren't you with him?

60
00:02:58,667 --> 00:02:59,967
Nothing.

61
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:01,833
Wait, why did you send me here?

62
00:03:01,967 --> 00:03:03,367
Andrew is there.

63
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,200
Threatened?

64
00:03:09,267 --> 00:03:12,333
I want us to be complete
before I open what I found.

65
00:03:12,467 --> 00:03:13,400
Okay.

66
00:03:13,533 --> 00:03:14,567
Found?

67
00:03:20,867 --> 00:03:22,167
This...

68
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:26,500
Joey found it in Major Aglipay's
belongings.

69
00:03:30,033 --> 00:03:33,133
I saw it on the sleeve
of Godfather Diego's jacket.

70
00:03:33,267 --> 00:03:35,967
I think he really meant
to leave it there

71
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:38,067
because what's inside
is important.

72
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:43,167
I wonder what it is.

73
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:50,867
Maybe some evidence or a list of
names of those in the syndicate.

74
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,567
Let's just find out.

75
00:04:08,367 --> 00:04:10,533
This is just a video file.

76
00:04:12,133 --> 00:04:14,167
Okay, let's watch it.

77
00:04:18,700 --> 00:04:21,333
<i>And you really planning on
running away from us?</i>

78
00:04:21,467 --> 00:04:24,000
<i>No, Lisa, no!
I really came here!</i>

79
00:04:24,133 --> 00:04:24,933
That's it!

80
00:04:25,067 --> 00:04:27,333
That's the video
that will free Father!

81
00:04:34,167 --> 00:04:36,467
Wait, let's rewind this.

82
00:04:39,733 --> 00:04:40,700
<i> Loloy, check what that is.</i>

83
00:04:40,833 --> 00:04:44,133
Maybe this is what your Korean
friend is saying.

84
00:04:44,267 --> 00:04:45,933
Theresa.

85
00:04:47,033 --> 00:04:50,500
But I haven't really
seen her yet.

86
00:04:50,633 --> 00:04:58,100
Joey, I think this is really the
solution to your father's case.

87
00:04:59,267 --> 00:05:03,067
You are going to be
with him very, very soon.

88
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:12,367
Thank God.

89
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:16,067
Thanks to all of you.

90
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:19,167
Oh my, I can't contain my joy.

91
00:05:19,300 --> 00:05:21,633
I want to celebrate.

92
00:05:21,767 --> 00:05:24,467
But, I'm scared.
I might jinx it.

93
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:29,367
Maybe I'll just celebrate
when Father is really free.

94
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:33,033
Also, to make it complete,
Jin Ho should be here.

95
00:05:33,167 --> 00:05:36,133
Because I can't do this
on my own.

96
00:05:37,567 --> 00:05:40,800
This only happened because
of the three of you.

97
00:05:40,933 --> 00:05:42,567
Thank you very much.

98
00:05:43,700 --> 00:05:48,900
Okay, I'll call Attorney
to give this to him,

99
00:05:49,033 --> 00:05:50,767
our evidence.

100
00:05:56,967 --> 00:05:59,267
We have to make sure
that it won't be dismissed.

101
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:01,567
Like what happened
with Golda's testimony.

102
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,833
I have an idea.

103
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:14,900
We gave the video to your
lawyer,

104
00:06:15,033 --> 00:06:18,067
and he said that it's very
strong for your case.

105
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:22,733
He also said that he's already
going through the evidence

106
00:06:22,867 --> 00:06:25,067
so that he can give it
to the court.

107
00:06:26,467 --> 00:06:29,833
And he's making sure that
the evidence won't be dismissed

108
00:06:29,967 --> 00:06:32,267
like what happened with Golda's
statement.

109
00:06:33,567 --> 00:06:36,633
So just a little bit, Father,
you can go home.

110
00:06:39,133 --> 00:06:41,233
We'll be together again.

111
00:06:42,567 --> 00:06:44,900
I can't believe it.

112
00:06:45,033 --> 00:06:46,600
Is what I'm hearing true?

113
00:06:46,733 --> 00:06:48,033
Me too.

114
00:06:48,167 --> 00:06:51,533
When the evidence first
landed in my hands,

115
00:06:53,033 --> 00:06:55,800
I thought to myself...

116
00:06:57,200 --> 00:07:00,200
Maybe even though
Godfather Diego is gone,

117
00:07:00,333 --> 00:07:03,900
he wants to make amends with us.
He wants to help us.

118
00:07:04,033 --> 00:07:07,333
Maybe that's why the last time
we met,

119
00:07:07,467 --> 00:07:10,900
it was like he wanted
to tell me something.

120
00:07:11,033 --> 00:07:12,833
Maybe this is it.

121
00:07:12,967 --> 00:07:15,567
He hid the video

122
00:07:15,733 --> 00:07:19,333
because he knew it would be the
one that would set you free.

123
00:07:19,467 --> 00:07:21,233
Maybe you're right.

124
00:07:22,633 --> 00:07:23,700
You know,

125
00:07:23,833 --> 00:07:26,800
I believe that Diego was only
torn with the situation.

126
00:07:26,933 --> 00:07:30,767
And he did this because he wants
to protect me.

127
00:07:30,900 --> 00:07:32,667
He's probably trying to keep me

128
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,700
from getting killed
by the syndicate.

129
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:42,000
But it's just sad that our
friendship has come to this.

130
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,700
Jin Ho!

131
00:07:58,833 --> 00:08:01,800
What happened?
Did you catch Theresa? Jin Ho!

132
00:08:01,933 --> 00:08:04,933
Not yet, but I know I'm close.

133
00:08:05,067 --> 00:08:06,200
That's nice.

134
00:08:06,333 --> 00:08:08,000
Me too, I have good news
for you too.

135
00:08:08,133 --> 00:08:09,367
What?

136
00:08:09,500 --> 00:08:11,933
Joey found the video.

137
00:08:12,067 --> 00:08:15,400
You know,
the broken USB flash drive.

138
00:08:15,533 --> 00:08:17,033
There's a copy.

139
00:08:17,167 --> 00:08:19,100
- Really? Where?
- Yeah.

140
00:08:20,167 --> 00:08:22,800
Joey? She's visiting her father.

141
00:08:22,967 --> 00:08:24,433
I mean, the video, where is it?

142
00:08:24,567 --> 00:08:26,467
The video...

143
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:29,400
Joey sent it to the attorney
for evidence.

144
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,300
Ma'am Yvette.

145
00:08:38,433 --> 00:08:40,800
Hey, Clarissa, I've been looking
for you for a while.

146
00:08:40,933 --> 00:08:42,067
I'm sorry.

147
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,667
I was just fixing up
the conference room.

148
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:45,900
It was used earlier.

149
00:08:46,033 --> 00:08:47,800
You're really hardworking.

150
00:08:47,933 --> 00:08:51,167
That's why it's not too hard
for me to help you.

151
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:54,400
That's why we're going
to help you now.

152
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,700
This is my husband.

153
00:09:00,967 --> 00:09:02,867
Tomas, Clarissa.

154
00:09:04,033 --> 00:09:05,867
Nice to meet you.

155
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,467
Nice to meet you.

156
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:11,367
I heard that you need help
with your husband's case.

157
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:16,167
That's why I told my wife that
I wanted to meet you in person.

158
00:09:17,300 --> 00:09:22,900
Yes, but I don't want
to bother you anymore.

159
00:09:24,167 --> 00:09:30,300
Because my husband's case
is getting stronger.

160
00:09:30,467 --> 00:09:32,033
What do you mean?

161
00:09:32,167 --> 00:09:35,433
There's a new evidence
that has just come out.

162
00:09:35,567 --> 00:09:37,033
What evidence?

163
00:09:43,067 --> 00:09:44,567
What evidence?

164
00:09:50,133 --> 00:09:53,233
Later, make sure our cargo
is ready, so...

165
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,467
What? Did you find it?

166
00:10:02,067 --> 00:10:03,067
I knew it.

167
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,567
You're not going
to keep your word.

168
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:08,467
There you go again,
you're too excited.

169
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,700
Didn't I say I'd give it to you?

170
00:10:10,833 --> 00:10:12,833
That's it.

171
00:10:12,967 --> 00:10:14,300
You know,

172
00:10:15,367 --> 00:10:21,067
I need to see Berdugo because
he owes Diego and me big time.

173
00:10:21,867 --> 00:10:23,033
Okay.

174
00:10:23,167 --> 00:10:24,800
Okay, I'll tell you.

175
00:10:24,933 --> 00:10:26,800
Are you ready to know?

176
00:10:26,933 --> 00:10:33,000
I'm sorry, because our lawyer
said not to talk

177
00:10:33,133 --> 00:10:37,233
about the latest developments
in my husband's case.

178
00:10:38,333 --> 00:10:39,733
Sorry.

179
00:10:39,867 --> 00:10:40,867
Look.

180
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,300
You asked for my help

181
00:10:43,433 --> 00:10:46,300
but how can I do
that if I don't know the facts?

182
00:10:48,967 --> 00:10:50,400
You can trust me.

183
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:57,633
Maybe, we don't need
to know anymore, Hon.

184
00:10:57,767 --> 00:11:00,400
We just need to understand
Clarissa.

185
00:11:01,533 --> 00:11:05,800
Of course, she doesn't want to
jeopardize her husband's case.

186
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:09,800
I understand.

187
00:11:11,933 --> 00:11:15,533
Well, I wish the best for you
and your husband, Clarissa.

188
00:11:15,667 --> 00:11:18,100
Thank you, Sir. I'm sorry.

189
00:11:19,233 --> 00:11:21,533
Excuse me, Hon.
I just have to make a call.

190
00:11:21,667 --> 00:11:22,700
Okay.

191
00:11:28,067 --> 00:11:29,533
Just step aside.

192
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:35,867
There was an encounter
on Godfather's birthday,

193
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:38,800
that's why his reputation
was ruined.

194
00:11:38,933 --> 00:11:40,933
He looked weak,

195
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:43,433
and that's the opportunity
Berdugo has been waiting

196
00:11:43,567 --> 00:11:45,000
for to penetrate the North.

197
00:11:46,133 --> 00:11:47,167
You know, until now,

198
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:51,033
you still haven't told me
where I can find Berdugo.

199
00:11:51,167 --> 00:11:53,300
If you want to see him,

200
00:11:53,433 --> 00:11:56,000
he'll be meeting with his
new business partners

201
00:11:56,133 --> 00:11:57,300
at the end of the month.

202
00:11:58,467 --> 00:11:59,767
New business partners?

203
00:12:00,900 --> 00:12:02,533
Where will they meet?

204
00:12:08,367 --> 00:12:09,967
Matias, Lisa...

205
00:12:10,100 --> 00:12:13,000
Delgado has a new evidence.

206
00:12:13,133 --> 00:12:16,000
Find out what that is. Hurry up!

207
00:12:24,967 --> 00:12:25,967
Hey.

208
00:12:29,167 --> 00:12:30,100
Where's Joey?

209
00:12:30,233 --> 00:12:33,233
Joey's not here.
She went to visit her Father.

210
00:12:33,367 --> 00:12:35,500
But Golda's upstairs. Why?

211
00:12:37,067 --> 00:12:39,200
You're the one that I need
sto talk to.

212
00:12:40,233 --> 00:12:41,833
Okay.

213
00:12:41,967 --> 00:12:42,933
About what?

214
00:12:43,867 --> 00:12:45,633
The video evidence.

215
00:12:45,767 --> 00:12:49,467
You know, the one with Theresa's
face on it...

216
00:12:49,633 --> 00:12:52,100
Are you going to release it
to the public?

217
00:12:52,233 --> 00:12:53,367
Yeah,

218
00:12:54,833 --> 00:12:59,133
this is the only way to make
sure that the court accepts it

219
00:12:59,267 --> 00:13:01,833
as evidence for Joey's Father.

220
00:13:01,967 --> 00:13:06,133
Which means Theresa
will be exposed too.

221
00:13:06,267 --> 00:13:08,000
She'll be a wanted woman.

222
00:13:08,133 --> 00:13:10,833
Then the police will try
to find her.

223
00:13:10,967 --> 00:13:12,733
Isn't that good for you?

224
00:13:12,867 --> 00:13:15,200
I mean, now you have the
authorities,

225
00:13:15,333 --> 00:13:17,733
and they can help you find her.

226
00:13:17,867 --> 00:13:18,967
You know what?

227
00:13:19,100 --> 00:13:21,433
I think it's best for you
to like to coordinate

228
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,500
- with the police.
- No, no, no, no.

229
00:13:23,633 --> 00:13:25,600
I should be the one to find her.

230
00:13:27,533 --> 00:13:28,800
How come?

231
00:13:30,900 --> 00:13:32,033
You know what,

232
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:37,400
I have no idea why it has
to be you to catch Theresa,

233
00:13:37,533 --> 00:13:38,867
but I'm sorry.

234
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:42,800
This is Joey's last hope
to help her father.

235
00:13:44,467 --> 00:13:47,233
I have to release the video.

236
00:13:52,067 --> 00:13:56,967
From the video evidence found
in Major Aglipay's belongings,

237
00:13:57,133 --> 00:13:59,300
it looks like someone else
was involved

238
00:13:59,433 --> 00:14:01,467
in the death of Ramon Orbos.

239
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:05,033
The question now,<i> Ka-Tirada</i> ...

240
00:14:06,167 --> 00:14:10,300
What will happen to the case
of Major Miguel Delgado,

241
00:14:10,433 --> 00:14:14,300
who was first accused
of killing Ramon Orbos?

242
00:14:16,067 --> 00:14:20,467
Okay, shout out to Janice,
to Bailey, and...

243
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:24,133
Raven, yes.

244
00:14:24,267 --> 00:14:26,433
Thank you for watching.

245
00:14:26,567 --> 00:14:31,267
Lance and, Osmond.
Yes, yes, thank you.

246
00:14:43,433 --> 00:14:46,667
Judge, we have a favor to ask
from you.

247
00:14:46,800 --> 00:14:48,233
I know what you want to happen,

248
00:14:48,367 --> 00:14:50,867
but I can't ignore
the new evidence.

249
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,467
The video is out
on social media.

250
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:54,767
It's even gone viral.

